WEBVTT

00:00:02.320 --> 00:00:05.890
I'm showing all kinds of outside world stuff to you!

00:00:08.510 --> 00:00:09.440
Promise!

00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:22.750
Falulu? It's me! As promised.

00:00:25.130 --> 00:00:27.310
As promised.

00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:07.020
Falulu, can you tell who I am?

00:02:07.730 --> 00:02:09.020
I can.

00:02:11.260 --> 00:02:12.310
Lala.

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:17.070
Amazing! You got it right away! Vocal Doll power!

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:20.490
Okay, I'll show you around school like I promised!

00:02:20.490 --> 00:02:21.350
Yes.

00:02:21.350 --> 00:02:22.530
Nope!

00:02:22.530 --> 00:02:25.500
Huh? Falulu? Falulu!

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:27.200
Give it back, Unicorn.

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:28.280
Absolutely not!

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:30.700
You can't start getting along with Lala!

00:02:30.700 --> 00:02:31.820
Why not?

00:02:31.820 --> 00:02:34.190
The outside world is boring!

00:02:34.190 --> 00:02:36.980
But Lala said it's fun.

00:02:36.980 --> 00:02:40.590
She's just saying that to confuse you.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:46.600
No opening this!

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:48.560
You're getting horned you if you do!

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:52.020
What you need to be doing now is making more fans!

00:02:53.530 --> 00:02:56.870
So get to work on those autographs.

00:02:56.870 --> 00:02:58.530
Understood?

00:02:58.530 --> 00:02:59.360
Yes.

00:03:01.820 --> 00:03:03.950
Good girl, good girl.

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:06.710
Right, I'll get these to Meganee.

00:03:06.710 --> 00:03:08.350
Keep at it!

00:03:28.460 --> 00:03:30.000
No opening this!

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:31.980
I'll horn you if you do!

00:03:32.580 --> 00:03:35.940
<i>But I want to see!</i>

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:38.020
Falulu? Falulu!

00:03:38.020 --> 00:03:39.780
Hey, Falulu! Hello?

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:40.860
What are you up to?

00:03:40.860 --> 00:03:42.460
Oh, Minami.

00:03:42.460 --> 00:03:45.790
We're having a strategy meeting for the next show!

00:03:45.790 --> 00:03:47.080
Gather in the back yard!

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:48.790
Ca-Capisce!

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:54.250
What? You want to write the lyrics for your new song?

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:55.010
That's right.

00:03:55.010 --> 00:03:57.300
"That's right" like it's that easy-kuma!

00:03:57.300 --> 00:03:58.380
Lyrics?

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:00.560
We're writing the song ourselves!

00:04:00.560 --> 00:04:01.520
What?

00:04:01.520 --> 00:04:05.430
If we lose this Grand Prix, the Paradise Coord will really be Falulu's for good.

00:04:05.730 --> 00:04:07.450
We're backed into a corner.

00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:09.890
We have to do something totally new.

00:04:10.410 --> 00:04:14.860
Of course, we might end up having to ask for Meganii's help,

00:04:14.860 --> 00:04:18.110
but I want to <i>really</i> show off our passion!

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:21.570
Well, if you're that sure,

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:23.270
I've got your back-kuma!

00:04:23.270 --> 00:04:25.030
We have an agreement then.

00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:29.320
Prepare some keywords for a song before school's over today!

00:04:29.320 --> 00:04:30.610
Ca-Capisce!

00:04:30.610 --> 00:04:31.440
Dismissed!

00:04:31.440 --> 00:04:32.760
Capipisce!

00:04:35.150 --> 00:04:38.210
I have no idea how to write lyrics!

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:41.300
What happened with Falulu?

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:42.280
I'm here.

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:43.380
Finally!

00:04:44.100 --> 00:04:46.040
Should be safe here.

00:04:46.580 --> 00:04:49.310
Show me your school.

00:04:55.730 --> 00:04:57.390
You seeing it, Falulu?

00:04:57.390 --> 00:04:58.140
Yes.

00:04:58.830 --> 00:05:01.440
This is the entrance to the elementary school wing.

00:05:02.920 --> 00:05:05.530
Hey! No running!

00:05:05.900 --> 00:05:09.170
It's recess right now, so everyone's out here chatting,

00:05:09.170 --> 00:05:11.990
or preparing for their next class.

00:05:12.440 --> 00:05:14.460
Seems busy.

00:05:16.450 --> 00:05:21.170
And this is where I study: class 5-2!

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:22.880
Lively.

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:26.200
That's Nao! And Takahashi!

00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:28.790
Is that Falulu? Hello.

00:05:28.790 --> 00:05:32.100
Is that seriously her? Hey there!

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:36.310
Wow, a boy? I've seen those in books.

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:40.240
Just saying, but Takahashi isn't representative of all boys.

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:41.850
What are you saying?

00:05:41.850 --> 00:05:44.340
I meant it in a good way, honest!

00:05:44.340 --> 00:05:45.780
Oh I see!

00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:50.010
Hey there! Seriously? Seriously?

00:05:52.300 --> 00:05:54.200
Can anyone solve this?

00:05:55.340 --> 00:05:57.460
Of course I can't.

00:05:57.460 --> 00:05:59.920
Well, how about you, Manaka?

00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:03.100
Uhm...

00:06:03.100 --> 00:06:04.360
<i>It's three.</i>

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:06.380
It's three!

00:06:06.980 --> 00:06:12.370
Well done!

00:06:15.340 --> 00:06:17.970
Falulu, I'm back!

00:06:18.850 --> 00:06:21.680
She hasn't signed any more...

00:06:21.680 --> 00:06:23.730
Falulu? Falulu?

00:06:25.190 --> 00:06:28.150
Huh? She couldn't have...

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:32.060
Whaaat?

00:06:32.060 --> 00:06:36.840
Falulu disobeyed me and ran off with her PriPass?

00:06:36.840 --> 00:06:41.080
This has... This has never happened before!

00:06:41.480 --> 00:06:43.380
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:45.800
I gotta catch her quick!

00:06:46.860 --> 00:06:48.980
Where are we going next?

00:06:48.980 --> 00:06:51.830
It's recess again, so let's go see more of the grounds.

00:06:51.830 --> 00:06:54.220
How many times is it recess?

00:06:54.530 --> 00:06:56.930
Uhh... Five!

00:06:57.200 --> 00:06:58.550
That's a lot.

00:06:58.550 --> 00:07:00.630
What? It's not enough!

00:07:00.630 --> 00:07:01.750
It's Lala.

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:02.480
Go day.

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:06.920
Minami's gonna slap you with a warning ticket for walking while PriPassing.

00:07:06.920 --> 00:07:08.190
I'll be careful!

00:07:08.460 --> 00:07:10.660
That was Dressing Pafé.

00:07:10.660 --> 00:07:13.150
Huh? Wasn't that Falulu?

00:07:13.150 --> 00:07:14.120
Yeah.

00:07:14.570 --> 00:07:17.250
As to our method of defeating the aforementioned Falulu...

00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:17.830
Yes...

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:19.040
Usa?

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:23.370
Writing the lyrics for our next song ourselves? I like it!

00:07:23.370 --> 00:07:26.250
I'll come up with a bunch of cool stuff!

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:28.090
This is serious!

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:33.010
If this doesn't work, we won't even beat SoLaMi SMILE, much less Falulu.

00:07:34.160 --> 00:07:37.010
Right... I know that!

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:40.630
Steely resolve! Let's do this!

00:07:40.630 --> 00:07:43.770
Very well-usa. I'm rooting for you-usa!

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:50.220
What are they doing?

00:07:50.220 --> 00:07:52.970
It's lunch break so everyone's free to do whatever they want.

00:07:52.970 --> 00:07:53.860
Free?

00:07:57.390 --> 00:07:59.250
Lala!

00:07:59.730 --> 00:08:00.880
Non!

00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:02.570
What are you doing?

00:08:02.570 --> 00:08:03.710
Take a look!

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:06.100
Whoa, Lady Falulu!

00:08:06.100 --> 00:08:07.250
Hello.

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:11.570
Falulu! You're so good at singing!

00:08:11.570 --> 00:08:16.220
And you're so pretty and dreamy and just the perfect idol!

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:19.220
You're not Lala, but I still love you!

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:21.100
A doll?

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:22.020
What?

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:26.020
Uh... That's Non, my little sister.

00:08:26.020 --> 00:08:29.440
Non? What's a little sister?

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:35.780
Uh... A little sister is small... But pretty heavy...

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:39.060
And kinda cheeky and sort of scary... I guess.

00:08:39.060 --> 00:08:40.950
That's all wrong, though!

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:47.540
I'm the capable super cutie who always swoops in to save her useless big sister from trouble!

00:08:47.860 --> 00:08:48.630
Non...

00:08:49.640 --> 00:08:52.720
Allow me to express my joy in a physical form!

00:08:56.140 --> 00:08:59.600
Non is so spinny. Very cute.

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:03.480
Lady Falulu, allow me to show you my favorite place!

00:09:04.720 --> 00:09:06.270
The greenhouse!

00:09:09.880 --> 00:09:11.700
It's so warm!

00:09:11.700 --> 00:09:12.740
Flowers.

00:09:13.550 --> 00:09:14.950
Lots.

00:09:17.580 --> 00:09:20.760
These anemones are ones I planted and nurtured.

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:22.660
Non's taking care of plants and animals at school.

00:09:22.980 --> 00:09:24.330
Plants and animals...

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:26.430
Lady Falulu!

00:09:26.430 --> 00:09:29.000
This is for you, my Lady Falulu!

00:09:32.510 --> 00:09:37.090
Lala will bring this to you when she next comes to PriPara!

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:38.180
Capisce!

00:09:40.140 --> 00:09:43.140
Falulu!

00:09:45.420 --> 00:09:47.580
Where are you, Falulu!

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:48.400
Kuma!

00:09:49.320 --> 00:09:51.150
Wh-What was that for-kuma?

00:09:51.150 --> 00:09:53.010
Have you seen Falulu anywhere?

00:09:53.010 --> 00:09:54.700
N-No sirree-kuma.

00:09:54.700 --> 00:09:59.410
Oh no, where'd she go! Falulu! Falulu!

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:01.660
Well, she's out of sorts.

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:04.740
What a total greenhorn-usa.

00:10:16.330 --> 00:10:19.730
Small, but kind of heavy.

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:31.560
Right.

00:10:31.830 --> 00:10:34.450
That's what the flower is about-pri.

00:10:34.450 --> 00:10:35.370
Yeah.

00:10:35.370 --> 00:10:38.000
Falulu's never been outside, huh?

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:38.400
Poor thing.

00:10:40.430 --> 00:10:44.430
And did you two come up with some lyrics-pri?

00:10:44.430 --> 00:10:45.200
Yeah!

00:10:45.570 --> 00:10:49.260
A warm greenhouse, and what pretty flowers!

00:10:49.260 --> 00:10:51.180
What's a greenhouse doing there-pri?

00:10:51.180 --> 00:10:52.110
Anything else?

00:10:52.800 --> 00:10:57.760
What's for dinner today? Find out at Papa's Pasta, capisce?

00:10:57.760 --> 00:11:00.810
You're seriously just plugging the store-pri?

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:03.360
Next Sophie-pri?

00:11:03.360 --> 00:11:04.020
Okay.

00:11:05.700 --> 00:11:11.420
The rose cries out. In the sunshine wanna destiny?

00:11:11.420 --> 00:11:14.150
That makes no sense, and what's up with the English-pri?

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:16.070
What about you then?

00:11:16.420 --> 00:11:19.090
Ahem, let the recital begin-pri.

00:11:19.940 --> 00:11:22.400
Even a cat can lie around waiting...

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:26.070
Let us pierce the veil of darkness with radiant cyalume!

00:11:26.070 --> 00:11:29.580
My honeymoon with pi draws near!

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:31.040
Those aren't even yours!

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:39.690
Falulu's own Non!

00:11:39.690 --> 00:11:40.550
Falulu!

00:11:41.820 --> 00:11:44.290
Lala, Sophie, Mireille!

00:11:44.890 --> 00:11:45.760
Here.

00:11:46.340 --> 00:11:47.350
Thank you.

00:11:48.300 --> 00:11:49.570
How pretty.

00:11:55.520 --> 00:11:57.600
That's so cute!

00:11:59.490 --> 00:12:01.180
So this is Falulu's room?

00:12:01.180 --> 00:12:03.240
I guess it was back here all along.

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:04.910
Huh?

00:12:04.910 --> 00:12:06.540
Dressing Pafé?

00:12:06.540 --> 00:12:09.180
Oh, you're scouting out the enemy's plans too?

00:12:09.180 --> 00:12:10.570
We just had something to deliver-pri.

00:12:10.570 --> 00:12:12.120
Falulu, hello!

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:15.630
Come to think of it, Unicorn was running around looking for you.

00:12:15.630 --> 00:12:17.510
What, why?

00:12:18.690 --> 00:12:25.520
Unicorn said no, but I wanted to see the outside world and took her PriPass and ran away.

00:12:25.520 --> 00:12:26.570
What?

00:12:26.570 --> 00:12:28.560
Sorry, Unicorn...

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:30.840
Falulu's getting horned.

00:12:30.840 --> 00:12:33.770
Horned? Sounds painful.

00:12:34.310 --> 00:12:37.230
You were <i>that</i> interested in seeing it-pri?

00:12:37.920 --> 00:12:38.700
Yes.

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:45.160
Falulu!

00:12:45.160 --> 00:12:46.180
Unicorn.

00:12:46.180 --> 00:12:48.870
Found you at last! You're in big trouble!

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:50.080
Here comes the horn!

00:12:54.110 --> 00:12:56.290
What do you think you're doing?

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:59.300
I won't allow you to attack an unarmed civilian!

00:12:59.300 --> 00:13:00.750
<i>Gogogogo!</i>

00:13:01.960 --> 00:13:03.440
Flee now!

00:13:11.200 --> 00:13:14.270
I'll just have to horn all of you!

00:13:23.940 --> 00:13:26.170
Hah! Up it is!

00:13:29.630 --> 00:13:31.520
We should be safe here.

00:13:31.520 --> 00:13:32.540
Yeah.

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:35.680
Huh? Aren't these our enemies?

00:13:35.680 --> 00:13:37.160
Why are we helping them?

00:13:37.160 --> 00:13:40.030
Yet we are also comrades, fighting upon the very same stage.

00:13:40.030 --> 00:13:41.970
She's right, Dorothy.

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:50.730
Look at that crummy old thing.

00:13:50.730 --> 00:13:52.610
This is Falulu's Non.

00:13:52.610 --> 00:13:53.560
Is it broken?

00:13:53.560 --> 00:13:55.030
Is that an important thing?

00:13:55.030 --> 00:13:56.890
It's stopped moving.

00:13:56.890 --> 00:13:58.040
It's fine.

00:13:58.040 --> 00:13:58.850
Huh?

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:00.360
I can fix it.

00:14:03.910 --> 00:14:05.150
There!

00:14:10.320 --> 00:14:12.790
Wow, that's awful! Give it here!

00:14:13.170 --> 00:14:16.040
I'm better with this kind of work than you'd think.

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:23.920
That's even worse! I'll do it!

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:25.380
No way, Lala!
Stop right there!

00:14:25.380 --> 00:14:27.340
Hand it over. This is disgraceful.

00:14:27.340 --> 00:14:30.880
What, you? This is my specialty.

00:14:32.980 --> 00:14:35.270
Cog A and cog B need to be linked...

00:14:35.550 --> 00:14:37.890
A has 24 teeth...

00:14:37.890 --> 00:14:40.050
It needs to rotate 30 times per minute...

00:14:40.050 --> 00:14:41.730
And with B having 12 teeth...

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:45.330
Oh, and did you two come up with any lyrics?

00:14:45.330 --> 00:14:50.200
Well, y'know, I'm not really feeling inspired...

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:53.100
What, you're writing lyrics too?

00:14:53.100 --> 00:14:55.620
What, you mean you guys are too?

00:14:56.280 --> 00:14:58.020
We need to step up our efforts.

00:14:58.020 --> 00:15:00.580
Gee, how about you guys quit copying us?

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:03.040
Right back at you-pri.

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:05.050
W-Well, good luck to both of us, huh?

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:08.540
Quit screwing around.

00:15:08.540 --> 00:15:11.790
You need this to fix it, don't you?

00:15:11.790 --> 00:15:13.300
Th-Thanks.

00:15:13.720 --> 00:15:15.130
And this.

00:15:15.130 --> 00:15:16.930
Thanks-pri.

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:25.260
Why are you helping Falulu?

00:15:25.260 --> 00:15:27.280
'Cause we're your friends, of course!

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:28.700
Friends?

00:15:28.700 --> 00:15:29.350
Yeah!

00:15:30.180 --> 00:15:32.410
What are friends?

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:35.830
Someone to compete with!

00:15:35.830 --> 00:15:38.290
They're fluffy like futons.

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:40.020
People who say nice things about me!

00:15:40.020 --> 00:15:40.750
Thanks.

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:45.170
Finished-pri!

00:15:53.300 --> 00:15:54.010
Pri...

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:56.930
Friends. Not needed.

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:01.410
Stop it!

00:16:01.800 --> 00:16:04.190
Do something, Leona.

00:16:05.780 --> 00:16:09.170
I'm not sure I can do it, but...

00:16:11.660 --> 00:16:16.490
A friend is someone you want to do something for.

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:17.940
What about Mireille?

00:16:20.170 --> 00:16:24.520
Someone who makes you feel good like you just solved a tough equation-pri!

00:16:25.860 --> 00:16:27.000
What about Lala?

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:29.450
Uh? Well...

00:16:32.470 --> 00:16:34.890
There's this warm feeling,

00:16:34.890 --> 00:16:37.390
and you feel like you want to snap Friend Tickets!

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:43.770
Hm? Wouldn't all that stuff make for good lyrics?

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:44.600
Oh...

00:16:45.260 --> 00:16:46.500
Yeah!

00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:49.020
It's fixed... Probably.

00:17:06.290 --> 00:17:07.240
Here you go.

00:17:15.300 --> 00:17:17.430
Falulu's Non...

00:17:18.690 --> 00:17:20.120
And friends.

00:17:23.260 --> 00:17:25.000
Warm.

00:17:27.950 --> 00:17:30.020
Coord Change Start!

00:17:30.020 --> 00:17:34.530
A coord with lots of snowy crystals and pearls.

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:37.110
Just seeing those luxuriant fur linings warms me all the way through.

00:17:37.110 --> 00:17:39.120
Crystal Snow Princess Coord!

00:18:47.350 --> 00:18:50.520
Making Drama Switch On!

00:19:12.140 --> 00:19:16.880
For you! Tick Tock Flower!

00:19:18.240 --> 00:19:21.020
Cyalume Change!

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:49.870
Lady Falulu is the greatest!

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:51.670
She seems different somehow!

00:19:51.670 --> 00:19:53.450
Yeah, that was incredible!

00:19:53.450 --> 00:19:55.280
I could feel that in my heart!

00:19:55.280 --> 00:19:56.380
Me too!

00:19:56.380 --> 00:19:58.090
You're the best, Falulu!

00:19:58.410 --> 00:20:03.010
Falulu... Falulu made her own Making Drama?

00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:06.760
All she did until now was copy...

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:09.320
I don't like this...

00:20:09.900 --> 00:20:14.230
This bad premonition is making my horn ache!

00:20:14.580 --> 00:20:16.160
Falulu did great!

00:20:16.160 --> 00:20:17.140
Yeah.

00:20:17.140 --> 00:20:20.440
I feel like I understand exactly how she felt.

00:20:20.800 --> 00:20:22.320
I have an idea.

00:20:23.320 --> 00:20:24.410
What is it?

00:20:24.410 --> 00:20:28.870
We should seriously make the lyrics based on that.

00:20:29.780 --> 00:20:32.080
Just what I was thinking.

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:33.040
What?

00:20:33.680 --> 00:20:37.660
I think we could make some lyrics that really speak of what we're feeling!

00:20:37.660 --> 00:20:41.670
Yes! Let us sing of our camaraderie!

00:20:41.670 --> 00:20:42.690
Sounds good, right?

00:20:42.690 --> 00:20:43.390
Yeah.

00:20:43.390 --> 00:20:44.000
Yes.

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:45.040
Capisce!

00:20:45.800 --> 00:20:49.610
So we're making a song for all six of us!

00:20:50.740 --> 00:20:53.530
Well, we're making a single song, right?

00:20:53.530 --> 00:20:55.730
We gotta sing it together!

00:20:55.730 --> 00:20:59.650
We get to sing together again! This is great!

00:21:00.130 --> 00:21:01.170
Right you are.

00:21:01.920 --> 00:21:04.220
I think it sounds great too.

00:21:04.220 --> 00:21:05.860
If you say so, Leona...

00:21:06.140 --> 00:21:09.580
Very well. If you all approve, I have no objection.

00:21:09.900 --> 00:21:11.970
That's what I was going to say-pri.

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:18.250
Well, let's go ask Meganii about a new composition-pri!

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:19.770
Warm.

00:21:19.770 --> 00:21:20.700
Futon.

00:21:20.700 --> 00:21:21.710
Wanna snap.

00:21:29.770 --> 00:21:31.630
We're counting on you!

00:21:32.960 --> 00:21:34.270
Capisce!

00:23:05.810 --> 00:23:10.690
It's finally the finals! We'll find out who really gets the Paradise Coord!

00:23:10.690 --> 00:23:13.330
I'm a little excited!

00:23:13.620 --> 00:23:15.530
I've never felt like this before.

00:23:15.530 --> 00:23:20.080
I'm excited too! I want to sing the song everyone poured their feelings into!

00:23:20.080 --> 00:23:20.830
We're gonna win!

00:23:20.830 --> 00:23:22.960
I'll win too.

00:23:22.960 --> 00:23:26.840
I want everyone to see the Making Drama made with my feelings.

00:23:27.120 --> 00:23:29.930
And when the show is over...

00:23:29.930 --> 00:23:32.580
Next time: The Last Battle On Stage!
